Herden includes and modifies software from these Apache-2.0 projects:

  herdr, https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr
  Heeler, https://github.com/ZingerLittleBee/Heeler

The native iOS application, plugin, relay, and landing site began from
Heeler. The Host runtime under runtime/ began from herdr. Herden's public
names, pairing flow, product integration, and subsequent features are
modifications made for this project. Exact source baselines and maintenance
policy are recorded in UPSTREAM.md and runtime/UPSTREAM.md.

Neither upstream project endorses Herden. Their names are used only to
describe the origin of the software.
